(text "E3-01 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §2.8; §5.2; §8 (пак IMU); §8.1 (пак IMU)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 36.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid f5dd23a0-0ef6-57af-ac5c-fc1803136c93))
(text "IMU assembly and two metre single-ended UART need bench verification. Internal named-pad wiring is specified,\nbut no physical harness has been measured.\nВорота (стенд): Check actual module revision, GX16 plug/socket viewing direction and continuity to E5 design\npinout; validate input Schottky and TVS at both ends; 1e6 frames with zero CRC errors. Upgrade to differential\ninterface if errors occur." (at 13.97 38.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 1d0b203f-d5b8-5b07-9247-67ab34f33612))
